__d(function(e,t,o,a,s,i,n){s.exports={titulo:"Help Center",subtitulo:"Step by step for every task in the app",busca_ph:"Type your question. E.g.: how do I price a blend?",busca_a11y:"Search for a question in the Help Center",busca_limpar:"Clear",busca_nada:"Nothing found with these words. Try another word (e.g. \"bill\", \"invoice\", \"price\") or browse the areas below.",resultados_one:"{{count}} task found",resultados_other:"{{count}} tasks found",comece:"Start here",comece_sub:"The most common questions from the back office",desta_tela:"Help for this screen",areas:"All tasks, by area",area_fabrica:"Factory: price, blends and raw materials",area_financeiro:"Finance: bills, bank statement and income statement",area_notas:"Invoices and tax obligations",area_clientes:"Customers, sales reps and field",area_laboratorio:"Laboratory",area_acessos:"Access and account",area_agente:"WhatsApp agent and voice",n_passos_one:"{{count}} step",n_passos_other:"{{count}} steps",voltar_lista:"All tasks",me_leve:"Take me there",fazer_tour:"Do it with the guided tour",tour_explica:"The tour opens the real screen and points to each button with a bubble. You can tap the highlighted button while you read.",passo_n:"STEP {{n}}",so_manual:"This step happens in a window that opens on top of the screen. The guided tour shows you up to the button that opens the window; from here on, follow the steps here.",dica:"Tip",cuidado:"Watch out",zap_titulo:"Want the agent to do it for you?",zap_texto:"Send this message to the Oscarpes agent on WhatsApp, or speak to it using the round Oscarpes button in the app:",zap_abrir:"Open in WhatsApp with the message",zap_escolha:"WhatsApp will ask you to pick the chat: choose the Oscarpes agent. Before saving anything, it shows a summary and waits for your YES.",glossario:"Glossary",glossario_sub:"Hard words, explained",glossario_rotulo:"GLOSSARY",glossario_dica:"In the step text, an underlined word has an explanation: tap it.",entendi:"Got it",tour_passo_de:"Step {{n}} of {{total}}",tour_pular:"Skip",tour_voltar:"Back",tour_proximo:"Next",tour_concluir:"Finish",tour_nao_achei:"I couldn't find this button on the screen. It appears after the previous step (tap what was highlighted) or it is further down (scroll the screen).",tour_fora:"The button is off the screen: scroll down (or up) until you see the orange outline.",tour_janela:"Tapping it opens a window. What to do in it is in the Help Center, in this same task.",botao_a11y:"Open the Help Center for this screen",perfil_titulo:"HELP",perfil_atalho:"Help Center \u2014 step by step for the app",il_a11y:"Drawing of the {{tela}} screen",tela_inicio:"Home",il_mais:"\uff0b (add new button)",il_receita_bruta:"Gross revenue",il_resultado_financeiro:"Financial result",il_custo_producao:"Production cost",il_despesa_adm:"Administrative expense",il_nao_entra:"Excluded",il_cliente_a:"Customer A",il_cliente_b:"Customer B",il_pdf:"PDF",il_7_dias:"7 days",il_30_dias:"30 days",il_portugues:"Portugu\xeas",il_ingles:"English",il_espanhol:"Espa\xf1ol",il_botao_oscarpes:"Round Oscarpes button (bottom right corner)",il_zap_exemplo_1:"\"What's the price of the blend with 6% boron and 4% manganese, freight of 180 per ton, 5% commission and 10% margin?\"",il_zap_exemplo_2:"\"What's overdue in accounts payable?\"",il_zap_exemplo_3:"\"How does the 2026 income statement look?\"",il_zap_confirma:"Summary of what will be saved. Is it right? Reply YES.",il_sim:"YES"}},798,[]);
__d(function(e,t,a,o,i,n,r){i.exports={margem_nome:"Margin (net margin)",margem_def:"How much profit is left for every R$ 100 sold, after paying for everything: raw materials, freight, commission and taxes. A 10% margin = out of every R$ 100 of sales, R$ 10 is profit.",custo_nome:"Production cost",custo_def:"Everything the factory spends to make one ton: raw materials (including the loss), outsourcing (grinding, blending, granulation), big bag and freight.",frete_nome:"Freight (R$ per ton)",frete_def:"The transport cost divided by the tons. In the calculator, freight is always PER TON, never the price of the whole truck. E.g.: freight to Prad\xf3polis of R$ 180/t \u2192 type 180.",comissao_nome:"Commission",comissao_def:"The share of the sale that goes to the sales rep (salesperson). It is a percentage of the sale amount. E.g.: 5% of a R$ 100,000 sale = R$ 5,000.",lucro_real_nome:"Lucro Real",lucro_real_def:"Lucro Real (actual-profit tax regime) is the tax regime of the group's companies. Under it, IRPJ and CSLL are calculated on the real profit (what is left over), not on revenue. If there was no profit, these two are not charged.",icms_nome:"ICMS",icms_def:"State tax (similar to a sales tax) charged on the sale value of goods. The percentage used in the calculations is in Factory \u203a Settings.",pis_cofins_nome:"PIS and COFINS",pis_cofins_def:"Two federal taxes charged on the sale value. For fertilizer, the rate is currently small (Complementary Law 224/2025). The percentages are in Factory \u203a Settings.",irpj_csll_nome:"IRPJ and CSLL",irpj_csll_def:"The two federal taxes on PROFIT (corporate income tax and social contribution on net profit). IRPJ has an extra part (surcharge) only on the profit above a monthly limit.",quebra_nome:"Shrinkage (manufacturing loss)",quebra_def:"The raw material lost in the process (dust, leftovers, moisture). If shrinkage is 10%, you need to buy a bit more raw material to deliver 1 ton.",lote_base_nome:"Base batch",lote_base_def:"The size of the blend's recipe, in tons. The ingredients are written for this size; the calculator scales them up or down to the quantity ordered.",garantia_nome:"Guarantee",garantia_def:"The amount of each nutrient the fertilizer promises on the label. E.g.: \"B 5%, Zn 10%\" = 5% boron and 10% zinc.",rascunho_nome:"Draft / Partial / Confirmed",rascunho_def:"The status of the blend. Draft = still being put together. Partial = almost ready. Confirmed = recipe checked. A blend in draft cannot go into the customers' price table.",cotacao_nome:"Quote (proposal)",cotacao_def:"The price offered to a customer, saved in the app. Later you mark what happened: accepted, declined, expired or turned into an order.",a_vencer_nome:"Not yet due",a_vencer_def:"A bill that has not reached its payment date (due date) yet. It is still on time.",vencido_nome:"Overdue",vencido_def:"A bill whose payment date has passed and that has not been paid (or received) yet. It may carry interest and a late fee.",baixa_nome:"Mark as paid",baixa_def:"Record in the system that a bill was paid or received. The bill leaves the list of open items.",extrato_nome:"Bank statement",extrato_def:"The list of everything that came in and went out of the bank account, with date, description and amount. You download it from the bank's website.",ofx_nome:"OFX",ofx_def:"A statement file format that every bank offers (sometimes it shows up as \"Money\"). It is the easiest one to paste into the app, because it already comes organized.",conciliacao_nome:"Bank reconciliation",conciliacao_def:"Checking each line of the bank statement against the bill it paid or received. When every line has a match, the statement is \"reconciled\".",despesa_adm_nome:"Administrative expense",despesa_adm_def:"An office cost that is not part of making the fertilizer: payroll, owners' pay, rent, electricity, accounting, software. It reduces profit and, under Lucro Real, reduces tax.",dre_nome:"DRE",dre_def:"Income statement (DRE): the report that shows whether the company made a profit or a loss. Sales \u2212 costs \u2212 expenses \u2212 taxes = result. In the app it is the management DRE (for decisions); the official one is the accountant's.",receita_bruta_nome:"Gross revenue (sales)",receita_bruta_def:"Everything that was sold, before taking out taxes and costs. It is the \"revenue\" figure.",omie_nome:"Omie",omie_def:"The management system the group still uses for invoices and bills. The app copies (mirrors) data from it; what is edited there shows up here on the next copy.",endividamento_nome:"Debt",endividamento_def:"Everything the company owes: bills payable to suppliers and also bank loans and financing. Today the app only records the bills payable.",nfe_nome:"NF-e (electronic invoice)",nfe_def:"The invoice for selling goods (the fertilizer). It is only valid after SEFAZ authorizes it.",nfse_nome:"NFS-e (service invoice)",nfse_def:"The SERVICE invoice (e.g. A Carpes lab analysis). It is issued to the city hall, not to SEFAZ.",cfop_nome:"CFOP",cfop_def:"A 4-digit code that says what kind of operation the invoice is (sale, resale, transfer, return\u2026). In the app you don't type the CFOP: you pick the operation and the issuer works it out.",xml_nome:"Invoice XML",xml_def:"The official file of the electronic invoice. This is what counts for the tax authority. Keep the XML and send it to the accountant.",danfe_nome:"DANFE",danfe_def:"The printed version (PDF) of the invoice, to travel with the goods and to read easily. The XML is what counts.",sefaz_nome:"SEFAZ",sefaz_def:"The State Finance Department (state tax authority): it authorizes invoices for goods and collects ICMS.",homologacao_nome:"Homologation \xd7 Production",homologacao_def:"Homologation is the TEST mode: the invoice goes to SEFAZ only to be checked, with no tax value. Production is the real invoice. The app always starts in homologation.",carta_correcao_nome:"Correction letter (CC-e)",carta_correcao_def:"An official notice that fixes a small mistake in an invoice already authorized (address, description). It does not fix amount, quantity, tax, CNPJ/CPF or date.",ncm_nome:"NCM",ncm_def:"An 8-digit code that classifies the product (e.g. the type of fertilizer). It goes on each item of the invoice.",ie_nome:"State registration (IE)",ie_def:"The company's (or grower's) registration number with the state, for ICMS. Whoever has an IE is an \"ICMS taxpayer\".",cif_fob_nome:"CIF and FOB",cif_fob_def:"Who pays the freight on the invoice. CIF = paid by us (the factory pays and delivers). FOB = paid by the customer (they pick it up or hire the freight).",apuracao_nome:"Monthly tax assessment",apuracao_def:"The month's tax calculation: adds up sales, takes out costs and expenses, and calculates IRPJ and CSLL on the profit."}},799,[]);
__d(function(e,t,a,o,i,r,n){i.exports={precificar_formula_titulo:"Price a blend (cost, freight, commission, margin and tax)",precificar_formula_resumo:"Find out what to sell a fertilizer for: the app adds up raw materials, freight, commission and taxes and shows the profit.",precificar_formula_busca:"price pricing calculate calculator how much sell value ton freight prad\xf3polis pradopolis commission margin tax lucro real icms cost blend formula pre\xe7o precificar calculadora frete comiss\xe3o margem f\xf3rmula",precificar_formula_p1_titulo:"Open the Calculator",precificar_formula_p1_texto:"In the bottom menu, tap Factory. In the shortcut grid, tap \"Calculator\".",precificar_formula_p2_titulo:"Choose \"Ready-made blend\"",precificar_formula_p2_texto:"Under \"Start from\", tap \"Ready-made blend\". (The other option, \"% of nutrient\", is for building a new product from the [[garantia|guarantees]].)",precificar_formula_p3_titulo:"Choose the blend",precificar_formula_p3_texto:"Tap \"Tap to choose the blend...\" and pick the fertilizer from the list that opens.",precificar_formula_p4_titulo:"Type the quantity",precificar_formula_p4_texto:"In \"Quantity (ton)\", type how many tons the customer wants. E.g.: 30.",precificar_formula_p5_titulo:"Type the freight per ton",precificar_formula_p5_texto:"In \"Freight (R$/ton)\", type the [[frete|freight]] for ONE ton. E.g.: freight to Prad\xf3polis of R$ 180/t \u2192 type 180. Just below, the app shows the freight for the whole batch.",precificar_formula_p6_titulo:"Choose the product type",precificar_formula_p6_texto:"Tap \"Granulated\" or \"Powdered\". This changes the outsourced service (granulation or blending) that goes into the [[custo|cost]].",precificar_formula_p7_titulo:"Type the commission",precificar_formula_p7_texto:"In \"Salesperson commission (%)\", type the sales rep's [[comissao|commission]]. The app starts with 5.",precificar_formula_p8_titulo:"Type the sale price",precificar_formula_p8_texto:"Leave \"Mode\" on \"Price\" and type the price per ton in \"Sale price (R$/ton)\".",precificar_formula_p9_titulo:"Read the result",precificar_formula_p9_texto:"Scroll down. \"Sale price to pass on to the customer\" is the price. Right below come [[icms|ICMS]], [[pis_cofins|PIS and COFINS]], the commission, [[irpj_csll|IRPJ and CSLL]] (which under [[lucro_real|Lucro Real]] are charged on profit) and \"Batch profit\", with the [[margem|margin]].",precificar_formula_dica:"There is no \"Calculate\" button: the result updates on its own as you type. Want to see the math in your spreadsheet's layout? Open \"As in your Excel spreadsheet\", further down.",precificar_formula_cuidado:"Freight is PER TON, never the price of the whole truck. And taxes are not typed here: the percentages come from Factory \u203a Settings.",precificar_formula_zap:"What's the price of a product with 6% boron and 4% manganese, freight of R$ 180 per ton, 5% commission and 10% margin?",preco_pela_margem_titulo:"Find the price from the margin I want",preco_pela_margem_resumo:"Say how much you want to make (e.g. 10% profit) and the app calculates the sale price.",preco_pela_margem_busca:"target margin desired profit price from margin want to make how much to charge markup margem lucro pre\xe7o",preco_pela_margem_p1_titulo:"Fill in the blend, quantity and freight",preco_pela_margem_p1_texto:"In the Calculator, do the usual steps: \"Ready-made blend\", choose the blend, the quantity in tons and the freight per ton.",preco_pela_margem_p2_titulo:"Switch Mode to \"Margin\"",preco_pela_margem_p2_texto:"Next to the commission, under \"Mode\", tap \"Margin\".",preco_pela_margem_p3_titulo:"Type the profit you want",preco_pela_margem_p3_texto:"In \"Desired net profit (% of revenue)\", type the [[margem|margin]]. E.g.: 10.",preco_pela_margem_p4_titulo:"Read the calculated price",preco_pela_margem_p4_texto:"You will see \"Price calculated to reach X% net profit\" and, right below, \"Sale price to pass on to the customer\".",preco_pela_margem_cuidado:"If the margin you ask for is impossible (costs and taxes already eat everything), the app warns you and shows no price. Lower the margin or review the costs.",preco_pela_margem_zap:"What price for the blend with 6% boron gives me a 12% margin, with freight of R$ 180 per ton and 5% commission?",imprimir_proposta_titulo:"Create the PDF proposal and save the quote",imprimir_proposta_resumo:"After calculating, save the customer's [[cotacao|quote]] and create the PDF to send.",imprimir_proposta_busca:"proposal pdf print offer quote quotation estimate customer sales rep send proposta cota\xe7\xe3o or\xe7amento imprimir",imprimir_proposta_p1_titulo:"Fill in the customer",imprimir_proposta_p1_texto:"With the price calculated, scroll down to \"Quote\". In \"Client\", type 3 letters of the name to search the records (or write the name). CPF/CNPJ and \"Validity (days)\" are optional.",imprimir_proposta_p2_titulo:"Print the quote",imprimir_proposta_p2_texto:"Tap \"Print quote (saves it and generates the PDF)\". It is saved as sent and the PDF opens. To just save it, without a PDF, use \"Save quote\".",imprimir_proposta_p3_titulo:"Other printouts",imprimir_proposta_p3_texto:"\"Print Sales Rep\" shows only the price (no cost). \"Print Admin\" shows the full calculation, with costs: it is for internal use only.",imprimir_proposta_dica:"To follow what happened to the proposal (accepted, declined, turned into an order), tap \"Open Quotes\".",imprimir_proposta_cuidado:"Never send the customer the \"Print Admin\" PDF: it shows cost and margin.",publicar_tabela_titulo:"Publish the price table for customers",publicar_tabela_resumo:"Updates the price growers see on the \"FERTILIZER PRICES\" screen \u2014 only the final price, never the cost.",publicar_tabela_busca:"price table publish price list fertilizer customer grower update table tabela de pre\xe7os publicar",publicar_tabela_p1_titulo:"Switch Mode to \"Margin\"",publicar_tabela_p1_texto:"In the Calculator, tap \"Margin\". The table is calculated from the margin, for all blends at once. The freight and commission typed on the screen also apply.",publicar_tabela_p2_titulo:"Type the margin",publicar_tabela_p2_texto:"In \"Desired net profit (% of revenue)\", type the table's margin.",publicar_tabela_p3_titulo:"Tap \"Publish price table\"",publicar_tabela_p3_texto:"It is at the bottom of the screen. The app shows how many blends will go in and which are left out. Confirm with \"Publish\".",publicar_tabela_dica:"The grower only sees the final price per blend, in \"FERTILIZER PRICES\". Cost, margin and composition never leave the app.",publicar_tabela_cuidado:"If any blend is in [[rascunho|Draft]], NOTHING is published. Confirm the blends first (Factory \u203a Blends \u203a tap the status).",atualizar_preco_insumo_titulo:"Enter the new price of a purchased raw material",atualizar_preco_insumo_resumo:"Bought raw material? Update the price paid per ton: that price is what builds the fertilizer price in the calculator.",atualizar_preco_insumo_busca:"raw material input bought purchase price paid ton update stock enter insumo mat\xe9ria-prima materia prima compra pre\xe7o",atualizar_preco_insumo_p1_titulo:"Open \"Raw materials\"",atualizar_preco_insumo_p1_texto:"In Factory, tap the \"Raw materials\" shortcut (the inputs screen).",atualizar_preco_insumo_p2_titulo:"Look for the old-price warning",atualizar_preco_insumo_p2_texto:"If the orange warning appears, some raw material has a price older than 15 days. Each card shows the price date; the \u26a0 marks the old ones.",atualizar_preco_insumo_p3_titulo:"Tap the raw material",atualizar_preco_insumo_p3_texto:"Tap the card of the raw material you bought.",atualizar_preco_insumo_p4_titulo:"Change the cost and save",atualizar_preco_insumo_p4_texto:"In the window that opens, replace \"Cost (R$/ton)\" with the price paid per TON (if the invoice is in kg, multiply by 1,000). If you like, also update \"Stock (ton)\". Tap \"Save\".",atualizar_preco_insumo_dica:"WhatsApp is faster: send a PHOTO of the invoice to the agent and it updates item by item, after you confirm.",atualizar_preco_insumo_cuidado:"The price date only changes when the AMOUNT changes. Saving the same price again does not clear the 15-day warning.",atualizar_preco_insumo_zap:"Update the price of zinc oxide to R$ 6,200 per ton",cadastrar_insumo_titulo:"Add a new raw material",cadastrar_insumo_resumo:"A raw material that doesn't exist in the app yet (e.g. a new boron supplier).",cadastrar_insumo_busca:"add new raw material input nutrient grade register cadastrar insumo mat\xe9ria-prima",cadastrar_insumo_p1_titulo:"Tap \uff0b",cadastrar_insumo_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Raw materials, tap the \uff0b at the top right.",cadastrar_insumo_p2_titulo:"Fill in the details",cadastrar_insumo_p2_texto:"In the \"New raw material\" window: \"Name\", \"Stock (ton)\", \"Cost (R$/ton)\". If it contains a nutrient, fill in \"Nutrient\" (e.g. Zn) and \"Nutrient grade (%)\".",cadastrar_insumo_p3_titulo:"Save",cadastrar_insumo_p3_texto:"If it is a filler material (e.g. Phyllite), check \"Is filler\". Tap \"Save\".",cadastrar_insumo_zap:"Add the new raw material Manganese Sulfate 31%, cost R$ 5,800 per ton",criar_formula_titulo:"Create or change a blend (fertilizer recipe)",criar_formula_resumo:"The recipe of each fertilizer: name, guarantee, batch size and the ingredients.",criar_formula_busca:"blend formula recipe ingredient new fertilizer guarantee batch composition optimize f\xf3rmula receita",criar_formula_p1_titulo:"Tap \uff0b",criar_formula_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Blends, tap \uff0b. A blend named \"Nova f\xf3rmula\" (new blend) appears in the list, as a [[rascunho|Draft]].",criar_formula_p2_titulo:"Open the blend",criar_formula_p2_texto:"Tap \"Nova f\xf3rmula\" (or the blend you want to change) in the list.",criar_formula_p3_titulo:"Name, guarantee and batch",criar_formula_p3_texto:"Fill in \"Name\", \"Guarantee (promised composition)\" and \"Base batch (ton)\" \u2014 see [[lote_base|base batch]]. Tap \"Save changes\".",criar_formula_p4_titulo:"Add the ingredients",criar_formula_p4_texto:"Tap \"\uff0b raw material\", choose the raw material and type how many tons of it go into the base batch. The value is saved when you leave the field.",criar_formula_p5_titulo:"Change the status",criar_formula_p5_texto:"Tap the status (\"tap to change\") until it shows \"Confirmed\". Each tap saves right away.",criar_formula_dica:"Don't know the amounts? In \"Guarantees and composition optimizer\", enter the nutrient and the %, tap \"Optimize composition\" and then \"Save this composition to the blend\".",criar_formula_cuidado:"The \u2715 next to an ingredient removes it right away, without asking. And a blend in Draft blocks publishing the price table.",configurar_impostos_titulo:"Change taxes, default freight and factory loss",configurar_impostos_resumo:"The percentages the calculator uses in every calculation: ICMS, PIS, COFINS, IRPJ, CSLL, shrinkage, big bag, default freight and the minimum margin.",configurar_impostos_busca:"settings tax taxes icms pis cofins irpj csll shrinkage loss big bag default freight minimum margin rate configura\xe7\xf5es imposto al\xedquota",configurar_impostos_p1_titulo:"Open \"Settings\"",configurar_impostos_p1_texto:"In Factory, tap the last shortcut, \"Settings\".",configurar_impostos_p2_titulo:"Loss, big bag and default freight",configurar_impostos_p2_texto:"\"Manufacturing loss \u2014 shrinkage (%)\" is the [[quebra|shrinkage]]. \"Default freight (R$/ton)\" is the freight that comes pre-filled in the calculator.",configurar_impostos_p3_titulo:"Taxes",configurar_impostos_p3_texto:"Adjust \"ICMS (%)\", \"PIS on sales (%)\", \"COFINS on sales (%)\", \"IRPJ base (%)\", \"IRPJ surcharge (%)\", the monthly limit for the surcharge and \"CSLL (%)\". See [[icms|ICMS]] and [[irpj_csll|IRPJ and CSLL]].",configurar_impostos_p4_titulo:"Save",configurar_impostos_p4_texto:"Tap \"Save settings\". The calculator starts using the new values right away.",configurar_impostos_dica:"If you're unsure about a rate, ask the accountant before changing it: these percentages affect every price.",configurar_impostos_cuidado:"A field left blank is saved as ZERO.",terceirizacao_titulo:"Change the outsourcing price (granulation and blending)",terceirizacao_resumo:"The price per ton paid to grind, blend or granulate \u2014 it goes into the fertilizer cost.",terceirizacao_busca:"outsourcing service granulation blending grinding price ton terceiriza\xe7\xe3o servi\xe7o granula\xe7\xe3o mistura",terceirizacao_p1_titulo:"Tap the service",terceirizacao_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Outsourcing, tap the service card (e.g. Granulation).",terceirizacao_p2_titulo:"Change the price and save",terceirizacao_p2_texto:"Change \"Price (R$/ton)\" and, if you like, the \"Quote source\" (e.g. July contract). Tap \"Save\". For a new service, use \uff0b.",terceirizacao_cuidado:"The calculator finds the service by NAME: granulated uses \"Granulation\" and powdered uses \"Blending\". If you rename or delete them, it uses a fixed value and warns you.",cotacoes_titulo:"Follow up on quotes (accepted, declined, turned into an order)",cotacoes_resumo:"All the proposals that came out of the calculator, and what happened to each one.",cotacoes_busca:"quotes quotation proposal accepted declined expired order conversion cota\xe7\xf5es cotacoes proposta",cotacoes_p1_titulo:"Filter by status",cotacoes_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Quotes, use the buttons at the top: All, Draft, Sent, Accepted, Declined\u2026",cotacoes_p2_titulo:"Tap the quote",cotacoes_p2_texto:"Tap the card to open it.",cotacoes_p3_titulo:"Mark what happened",cotacoes_p3_texto:"\"Mark accepted\" asks for the actual closing price. \"Mark declined\" asks for the reason. \"Convert to order\" creates the sales order.",cotacoes_dica:"At the top you'll see the conversion rate (how many became sales) and the quoted \xd7 closed amount.",pedidos_venda_titulo:"Record a sales order and follow production",pedidos_venda_resumo:"Order pending \u2192 in production \u2192 completed. When completed, the app takes the raw materials out of stock.",pedidos_venda_busca:"order sale sales production complete start new order sell pedido venda produ\xe7\xe3o",pedidos_venda_p1_titulo:"Tap \uff0b",pedidos_venda_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Orders, tap \uff0b.",pedidos_venda_p2_titulo:"Fill in the order",pedidos_venda_p2_texto:"In the \"New order\" window: issuing company (CNPJ), blend, quantity (ton), sales rep, customer, sale price and due date. Tap \"Create order\".",pedidos_venda_p3_titulo:"Open the order",pedidos_venda_p3_texto:"Tap the order card in the list to see the raw materials needed.",pedidos_venda_p4_titulo:"Produce and complete",pedidos_venda_p4_texto:"Tap \"\u25b6 Start production\". When it's done, \"Complete production\".",pedidos_venda_cuidado:"\"Complete production\" takes the raw materials out of stock and adds the finished fertilizer. Check before tapping.",compras_insumo_titulo:"Place a purchase order for raw materials",compras_insumo_resumo:"Purchase open \u2192 sent \u2192 received. When received, the stock goes up.",compras_insumo_busca:"purchase buy raw material input purchase order receive stock shortage compra comprar insumo",compras_insumo_p1_titulo:"Automatic purchase",compras_insumo_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Purchases, \"Create automatic purchase\" builds the purchase with everything missing for the orders in the queue.",compras_insumo_p2_titulo:"Or a manual purchase",compras_insumo_p2_texto:"Tap \uff0b to open an empty purchase and add the raw materials.",compras_insumo_p3_titulo:"Receive the purchase",compras_insumo_p3_texto:"Open the purchase, tap \"Mark as sent\" and, when the load arrives, \"Receive (adds to stock)\".",compras_insumo_dica:"On the Factory dashboard, the critical stock box also takes you straight to Purchases.",importacao_revenda_titulo:"Simulate the sale of an imported product (resale)",importacao_revenda_resumo:"Products that are only bought abroad and resold (e.g. Ulexite/Boron): exchange rate, customs broker and import taxes.",importacao_revenda_busca:"import imported resale ulexite ulexita boron exchange rate customs broker importa\xe7\xe3o revenda c\xe2mbio",importacao_revenda_p1_titulo:"Open the product",importacao_revenda_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Import, tap the product (or \uff0b for a new one).",importacao_revenda_p2_titulo:"Simulate the sale",importacao_revenda_p2_texto:"Type the tons, choose Price or Margin and look at \"NET PROFIT\". The print buttons work as in the calculator.",contas_a_pagar_titulo:"See bills payable, overdue and not yet due",contas_a_pagar_resumo:"How much the company has to pay, what is already overdue and what is due in the next 7 days.",contas_a_pagar_busca:"accounts payable bills bill overdue due date pay paid interest supplier debt contas a pagar boleto vencida",contas_a_pagar_p1_titulo:"Open Finance",contas_a_pagar_p1_texto:"Tap Finance in the bottom menu (or Factory \u203a Finance).",contas_a_pagar_p2_titulo:"Tap the \"Payable\" tab",contas_a_pagar_p2_texto:"It is the third tab at the top.",contas_a_pagar_p3_titulo:"See overdue and upcoming",contas_a_pagar_p3_texto:"The \"OVERDUE\" box shows how many and the total [[vencido|overdue]]. Right below, \"Due within 7 days\".",contas_a_pagar_p4_titulo:"See the schedule",contas_a_pagar_p4_texto:"\"Payment schedule\" lists each bill [[a_vencer|not yet due]] or overdue, with payee and due date (an overdue date is highlighted).",contas_a_pagar_p5_titulo:"Mark as paid",contas_a_pagar_p5_texto:"Paid it? Tap \"\u2713 Paid\" on the bill and confirm. The payment date is set to today.",contas_a_pagar_dica:"Bills that arrive by e-mail show up in Factory \u203a E-mails, in the \"PAY TODAY\" box.",contas_a_pagar_cuidado:"This screen does not store interest or the list of bills already paid yet: a paid bill leaves the list. Paid with interest? Note it in Omie or ask the agent for the history of paid bills.",contas_a_pagar_zap:"What's overdue in accounts payable? And what's due in the next 7 days?",nova_conta_pagar_titulo:"Enter a bill payable (boleto)",nova_conta_pagar_resumo:"Record a bank slip (boleto) or bill that needs to be paid.",nova_conta_pagar_busca:"enter new bill payable boleto bank slip record expense due date payee lan\xe7ar conta a pagar",nova_conta_pagar_p1_titulo:"Open the \"Payable\" tab",nova_conta_pagar_p1_texto:"In Finance, tap the \"Payable\" tab.",nova_conta_pagar_p2_titulo:"Tap \"\uff0b New payable\"",nova_conta_pagar_p2_texto:"It is the big button at the top of the tab.",nova_conta_pagar_p3_titulo:"Fill in and save",nova_conta_pagar_p3_texto:"In the window: \"Description\" (e.g. Ulexite boleto batch 3), \"Payee\", \"Amount (R$)\", \"Due date\" and the category. Tap \"Save\".",nova_conta_pagar_cuidado:"Description, amount and due date are required. Write the due date like this: 20/08/2026 (day/month/year).",contas_a_receber_titulo:"See accounts receivable (who owes us)",contas_a_receber_resumo:"What customers still have to pay: overdue, not yet due and received.",contas_a_receber_busca:"accounts receivable receive payment customer owes default overdue not yet due omie receber cliente devendo",contas_a_receber_p1_titulo:"Tap the \"Receivable\" tab",contas_a_receber_p1_texto:"In Finance, tap the second tab.",contas_a_receber_p2_titulo:"See the three totals",contas_a_receber_p2_texto:"At the top: \"NOT YET DUE\", \"OVERDUE\" and \"RECEIVED\" \u2014 from orders made in the app.",contas_a_receber_p3_titulo:"See each bill",contas_a_receber_p3_texto:"\"Overdue\" and \"Not yet due\" list order, customer and amount. Received it? Tap \"Mark received\" \u2014 see [[baixa|mark as paid]].",contas_a_receber_p4_titulo:"See the Omie mirror",contas_a_receber_p4_texto:"Further down, \"Omie mirror\" shows the open items from [[omie|Omie]], with the overdue total. The date of the last copy appears in the notice.",contas_a_receber_p5_titulo:"Filter by company",contas_a_receber_p5_texto:"Use the \"All\" button and the name of each company. Tap a company to open its items.",contas_a_receber_cuidado:"The Omie mirror is read-only: marking an item as received or changing it is still done in Omie.",contas_a_receber_zap:"Who owes me money? How much is already overdue?",colar_extrato_titulo:"Paste the bank statement and reconcile",colar_extrato_resumo:"Brings the [[extrato|bank statement]] into the app and matches each credit to the order it paid.",colar_extrato_busca:"bank statement paste import ofx csv reconcile reconciliation match payment extrato banco conciliar",colar_extrato_p1_titulo:"Tap the \"Bank statement\" tab",colar_extrato_p1_texto:"In Finance, the first tab.",colar_extrato_p2_titulo:"Tap \"Paste bank statement (OFX or CSV)\"",colar_extrato_p2_texto:"It is the big button at the top.",colar_extrato_p3_titulo:"Paste and import",colar_extrato_p3_texto:"Download the statement from the bank's website as [[ofx|OFX]], open the file, copy everything and paste it in the box. (Line by line also works: date;description;amount.) Tap \"Import\".",colar_extrato_p4_titulo:"Match the payments",colar_extrato_p4_texto:"In \"Suggested reconciliations\", check each suggestion and tap \"\u2713 Match\". The order is marked paid on the bank date.",colar_extrato_p5_titulo:"Sort out the rest",colar_extrato_p5_texto:"In the \"Bank reconciliation\" block, tap the month, check the suggested category and tap \"\u2713 Confirm\" (or \"Change\"). See [[conciliacao|reconciliation]].",colar_extrato_dica:"A repeated line doesn't go in twice: the app tells you how many \"already existed\".",despesa_adm_titulo:"Enter an administrative expense (payroll, rent, accountant\u2026)",despesa_adm_resumo:"An office cost that reduces the month's profit and tax.",despesa_adm_busca:"administrative expense payroll owners pay rent electricity accounting admin cost enter despesa administrativa folha aluguel",despesa_adm_p1_titulo:"Tap the \"Expenses\" tab",despesa_adm_p1_texto:"In Finance, the fourth tab.",despesa_adm_p2_titulo:"Tap \"\uff0b Record administrative expense\"",despesa_adm_p2_texto:"The month's total appears right below.",despesa_adm_p3_titulo:"Fill in and save",despesa_adm_p3_texto:"In the window: \"Expense month (e.g. 2026-08)\", \"Amount\", \"Description\", category and \"Company\". Tap \"Save\".",despesa_adm_dica:"If you choose \"Group (all)\", the expense is split evenly among the companies in the tax assessment.",despesa_adm_cuidado:"The \u2715 next to the expense deletes it for good.",ver_dre_titulo:"See the income statement (profit or loss)",ver_dre_resumo:"Sales \u2212 costs \u2212 expenses = result, month by month, for each unit or the whole group.",ver_dre_busca:"income statement dre result profit loss p&l financial health month year unit resultado lucro preju\xedzo",ver_dre_p1_titulo:"Open the income statement",ver_dre_p1_texto:"In Factory, tap the \"Income statement (DRE)\" shortcut.",ver_dre_p2_titulo:"Choose the year",ver_dre_p2_texto:"Use the year arrows \u2039 and \u203a. The table shows January up to the current month, plus the Total column.",ver_dre_p3_titulo:"Choose the unit",ver_dre_p3_texto:"\"Fertilizantes (consolidated)\" adds up the factory units. There are also Head office, Campo Grande, Palmas, Ponta Por\xe3, Agricultura Inteligente and Group.",ver_dre_p4_titulo:"Read the table",ver_dre_p4_texto:"From top to bottom: [[receita_bruta|gross revenue]] (\"Receita bruta\"), deductions, net revenue, cost, gross profit, expenses and, at the end, the net result (\"Resultado l\xedquido\"). Drag the table sideways to see the other months.",ver_dre_p5_titulo:"Read \"Where the numbers come from\"",ver_dre_p5_texto:"The box at the end explains the sources: sales and purchases from [[omie|Omie]] by invoice date, and expenses from the app, e-mail and bank statement.",ver_dre_cuidado:"This is the management [[dre|DRE]], for making decisions. The official one is the accountant's. The \"Sem categoria\" (no category) line is a bill that has not been classified in Finance yet.",ver_dre_zap:"How does the 2026 income statement look? Did we make a profit or a loss?",faturamento_ano_titulo:"See the year's revenue",faturamento_ano_resumo:"How much the company sold in the year, month by month.",faturamento_ano_busca:"revenue sales sold turnover year annual orders omie how much sold faturamento vendas receita",faturamento_ano_p1_titulo:"Open the income statement and choose the year",faturamento_ano_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Income statement (DRE), use the arrows to choose the year.",faturamento_ano_p2_titulo:"Choose the unit",faturamento_ano_p2_texto:"Leave \"Fertilizantes (consolidated)\" for the whole factory, or tap a unit.",faturamento_ano_p3_titulo:"Read the gross revenue line",faturamento_ano_p3_texto:"The first line (\"Receita bruta\") is each month's revenue. The last column, \"Total\", is the year's.",faturamento_ano_cuidado:"The \"Revenue this month\" box on the Factory dashboard only adds up orders made INSIDE the app (still few). The real revenue, from Omie, is in the income statement. The app does not show the COUNT of Omie orders in the year yet.",faturamento_ano_zap:"What was the 2026 gross revenue in the income statement, month by month?",endividamento_titulo:"See how much the company owes (debt)",endividamento_resumo:"What the app already has about what is owed: bills payable, bills from e-mail and the financial result.",endividamento_busca:"debt owe owed how much do we owe loan financing bank total endividamento d\xedvida empr\xe9stimo financiamento",endividamento_p1_titulo:"Bills payable",endividamento_p1_texto:"In Finance \u203a \"Payable\", see the OVERDUE total and what is due within 7 days.",endividamento_p2_titulo:"Bills from e-mail",endividamento_p2_texto:"In Factory \u203a E-mails, \"PENDING BILLS\" shows the bills that arrived and have not been paid yet.",endividamento_p3_titulo:"Interest paid in the year",endividamento_p3_texto:"In the income statement, the financial result line (\"Resultado financeiro\") shows interest and fees paid and received.",endividamento_cuidado:"The app does NOT have the loans and financing screen yet (the balance owed to banks). Full [[endividamento|debt]] tracking is still done outside the app. Don't add the e-mail total to \"Payable\": it may be the same bill.",endividamento_zap:"How much do we owe in total? How much is overdue, and to whom?",planilha_gerencial_titulo:"Import the finance management spreadsheet",planilha_gerencial_resumo:"Brings the finance spreadsheet into the income statement without counting the same cost twice.",planilha_gerencial_busca:"management spreadsheet excel csv import dre category finance planilha gerencial importar",planilha_gerencial_p1_titulo:"Choose the company",planilha_gerencial_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Management spreadsheet, tap \"Fertilizantes\" or \"Agricultura Inteligente\" (and the unit, if needed).",planilha_gerencial_p2_titulo:"Enter the year",planilha_gerencial_p2_texto:"Only if the spreadsheet's months don't say the year.",planilha_gerencial_p3_titulo:"Choose the spreadsheet",planilha_gerencial_p3_texto:"Tap \"Choose spreadsheet (Excel or CSV)\".",planilha_gerencial_p4_titulo:"Answer the new categories",planilha_gerencial_p4_texto:"If \"New categories \u2014 which account?\" appears, type the account for each one (e.g. 2.04.01) and tap \"Use these accounts\". Check the \"Preview\".",planilha_gerencial_p5_titulo:"Save",planilha_gerencial_p5_texto:"Tap \"Save\". Only what the income statement wasn't counting yet goes in. \"Discard\" saves nothing.",planilha_gerencial_dica:"If the spreadsheet is the bank statement itself with notes, the app recognizes it on its own and shows a dry run before saving.",comprovantes_titulo:"Match a payment receipt",comprovantes_resumo:"The receipts posted in the WhatsApp payments group, linked to the bill and the bank statement.",comprovantes_busca:"receipt payment proof pix group whatsapp link match comprovante pagamento",comprovantes_p1_titulo:"Choose the filter",comprovantes_p1_texto:"In Finance \u203a \"Receipts\", start with \"Pending\".",comprovantes_p2_titulo:"Search",comprovantes_p2_texto:"Search by name, amount or number (e.g. C12).",comprovantes_p3_titulo:"Open and link",comprovantes_p3_texto:"Tap the receipt. In \"Link manually\", tap the matching bill payable (it is marked paid) or the bank statement line. If it isn't the company's, \"Not the company's\".",comprovantes_dica:"The agent reads the receipts from the allowed group on its own. You only handle what it couldn't match.",apuracao_mensal_titulo:"See the month's tax assessment (Lucro Real)",apuracao_mensal_resumo:"The month's tax calculation: sales \u2212 taxes \u2212 commission \u2212 costs \u2212 expenses = profit, plus IRPJ/CSLL.",apuracao_mensal_busca:"tax assessment tax month monthly lucro real irpj csll closing apura\xe7\xe3o apuracao imposto",apuracao_mensal_p1_titulo:"Choose the month",apuracao_mensal_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Monthly Tax Assessment, use the arrows \u2039 and \u203a.",apuracao_mensal_p2_titulo:"Choose the company",apuracao_mensal_p2_texto:"\"All\" or one company (CNPJ).",apuracao_mensal_p3_titulo:"Read the statement",apuracao_mensal_p3_texto:"\"Monthly statement\" shows each deduction down to \"NET PROFIT FOR THE MONTH\". See [[apuracao|tax assessment]].",apuracao_mensal_cuidado:"The tax assessment only adds up orders COMPLETED inside the app. While sales go through Omie, it stays incomplete: use the income statement. There is no \"close the month\" button \u2014 the calculation is done on the spot.",emails_boletos_titulo:"See the bills and e-mails the agent sorted",emails_boletos_resumo:"The agent reads the inbox and sorts out: what to pay today, pending bills, what to reply to and notices.",emails_boletos_busca:"e-mail email bill boleto inbox pay today receipt scam fraud",emails_boletos_p1_titulo:"See the summary",emails_boletos_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a E-mails, the first box says how many items need attention and when the agent last read the inbox.",emails_boletos_p2_titulo:"Pay what is due today",emails_boletos_p2_texto:"\"PAY TODAY\" lists what is overdue and what is due today. Paid it? Tap \"+ RECEIPT (mark as paid)\" and choose the receipt, or \"\u2713 no receipt\".",emails_boletos_p3_titulo:"See the resolved ones",emails_boletos_p3_texto:"At the end, \"Show resolved\" opens the history of bills already paid.",emails_boletos_dica:"Date wrong or missing? Tap the bill's date and type it (e.g. 28/08/2026). E-mail marked \"POSSIBLE SCAM\": don't pay before checking.",notas_recebidas_titulo:"See the invoices suppliers issued to the company",notas_recebidas_resumo:"Every invoice that [[sefaz|SEFAZ]] shows as issued to the group's CNPJs, with the [[xml|XML]] and the [[danfe|DANFE]].",notas_recebidas_busca:"received invoices supplier sefaz purchase invoice nfe xml danfe incoming cte notas recebidas fornecedor",notas_recebidas_p1_titulo:"Open \"Received invoices\"",notas_recebidas_p1_texto:"In Factory, tap the received invoices (SEFAZ) shortcut.",notas_recebidas_p2_titulo:"Choose the unit",notas_recebidas_p2_texto:"Tap \"All\" or a unit (Matriz, PP, TO, CG, A Carpes).",notas_recebidas_p3_titulo:"Search for the supplier",notas_recebidas_p3_texto:"Type the name or the CNPJ and press Enter (search) on the keyboard.",notas_recebidas_p4_titulo:"Open the XML or the DANFE",notas_recebidas_p4_texto:"On the invoice card, tap \"Open XML\" or \"Open DANFE\".",notas_recebidas_p5_titulo:"Link it to the bill payable",notas_recebidas_p5_texto:"Tap \"Link to a payable\" and choose the bill from the list.",notas_recebidas_cuidado:"A card with a red border needs attention: \"New supplier\" (never sent an invoice before \u2014 check the purchase exists), a high amount or an odd NCM. An invoice marked \"SEFAZ summary only\" has no items or due date yet.",notas_entrada_titulo:"Check an incoming invoice and mark it paid",notas_entrada_resumo:"The invoices suppliers charge us: check them, read the XML to bring in amount and due date, and mark as paid.",notas_entrada_busca:"incoming invoice check xml mark paid supplier overdue access key nota de entrada dar baixa",notas_entrada_p1_titulo:"See the totals",notas_entrada_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Incoming Invoices, the three boxes show \"PAYABLE\", \"OVERDUE\" and \"THIS MONTH\".",notas_entrada_p2_titulo:"Choose the tab",notas_entrada_p2_texto:"\"Payable\", \"Overdue\", \"To check\", \"Key\", \"To classify\" or \"All\".",notas_entrada_p3_titulo:"Read the XML",notas_entrada_p3_texto:"Invoice with no amount? Tap \"Read XML\", then \"Choose XML file\" (or paste the content and tap \"Analyze the XML\"). Check what will change and tap \"Save\".",notas_entrada_p4_titulo:"Mark as paid",notas_entrada_p4_texto:"Paid it? \"Mark as paid\" and confirm. Made a mistake? \"Reverse\" undoes it.",notas_entrada_dica:"\"Checked\" marks the invoice as checked by you.",notas_entrada_cuidado:"Invoice with a problem in the access key: don't pay without checking \u2014 it could be a scam.",classificar_notas_titulo:"Classify invoices for the tax assessment",classificar_notas_resumo:"Say whether the invoice is a production cost, an administrative expense or is excluded.",classificar_notas_busca:"classify invoice tax assessment production cost administrative expense to classify classificar nota apura\xe7\xe3o",classificar_notas_p1_titulo:"Open the \"To classify\" tab",classificar_notas_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Incoming Invoices.",classificar_notas_p2_titulo:"Choose the class",classificar_notas_p2_texto:"Tap the invoices to select them (or \"All\") and tap \"Production cost\", \"Administrative expense\" or \"Excluded\". You can also classify one invoice at a time, on its card.",classificar_notas_cuidado:"Only invoices classified as \"Administrative expense\" go into the tax assessment. Raw material is a production cost, not an expense.",emitir_nfe_titulo:"Issue a sales invoice (NF-e)",emitir_nfe_resumo:"The [[nfe|NF-e]] goes into a queue; the issuer sends it to SEFAZ and the queue shows the result.",emitir_nfe_busca:"issue invoice nfe nf-e sale outgoing cfop issuing customer product emitir nota fiscal venda",emitir_nfe_p1_titulo:"Open \"Invoices (issuing)\"",emitir_nfe_p1_texto:"In Factory, tap the \"Invoices (issuing)\" shortcut.",emitir_nfe_p2_titulo:"Tap \"New invoice\"",emitir_nfe_p2_texto:"It is the second tab, at the top.",emitir_nfe_p3_titulo:"1. Issuing unit",emitir_nfe_p3_texto:"Choose the unit (Matriz, CG, TO or PP). If something is missing from its records, the app asks for it right there.",emitir_nfe_p4_titulo:"2. Customer",emitir_nfe_p4_texto:"Search by name, CNPJ or CPF and tap the customer. If the record is incomplete, complete it there (address, [[ie|IE]]\u2026).",emitir_nfe_p5_titulo:"3. Operation",emitir_nfe_p5_texto:"Choose: sale of own production, resale, transfer, shipment, free goods. You don't type the [[cfop|CFOP]] or the tax: the issuer works it out.",emitir_nfe_p6_titulo:"Environment",emitir_nfe_p6_texto:"Leave \"Homologation (test)\" to practice. \"Production\" is the real invoice \u2014 see [[homologacao|homologation]].",emitir_nfe_p7_titulo:"4. Items",emitir_nfe_p7_texto:"Search for the product or fill in: description, [[ncm|NCM]], quantity and unit price. \"+ Item\" adds another one.",emitir_nfe_p8_titulo:"5. Freight",emitir_nfe_p8_texto:"Choose who pays: paid by us ([[cif_fob|CIF]]), by the customer (FOB), by third parties, or no freight.",emitir_nfe_p9_titulo:"6. Payment",emitir_nfe_p9_texto:"Boleto, PIX\u2026 and the installments. \"Split the total evenly\" divides the amount.",emitir_nfe_p10_titulo:"Issue it",emitir_nfe_p10_texto:"Tap \"Issue in homologation (test)\" (or in production). Follow it in the \"Queue\" tab.",emitir_nfe_dica:"If the screen says \"Issuer not switched on yet\", invoices keep going out through Omie for now.",emitir_nfe_cuidado:"In production the app asks for TWO confirmations: the invoice is real. If in doubt, talk to the accountant first.",cancelar_nfe_titulo:"Cancel an invoice or send a correction letter",cancelar_nfe_resumo:"Cancel an authorized NF-e or fix a small mistake with the [[carta_correcao|correction letter]].",cancelar_nfe_busca:"cancel invoice cancellation correction letter cce fix wrong invoice cancelar nota carta de corre\xe7\xe3o",cancelar_nfe_p1_titulo:"Open the \"Queue\" tab",cancelar_nfe_p1_texto:"In Invoices (issuing), on the \"Queue\" tab, find the \"Authorized\" invoice.",cancelar_nfe_p2_titulo:"Choose what to do",cancelar_nfe_p2_texto:"On the card: \"Cancel\" or \"Correction letter\".",cancelar_nfe_p3_titulo:"Write the reason and send",cancelar_nfe_p3_texto:"Write the justification (at least 15 characters) and tap \"Request cancellation\" (or \"Send letter\"). Confirm.",cancelar_nfe_cuidado:"Cancellation is only possible up to 24 hours after authorization, and it can't be undone. The correction letter does not change amount, quantity, tax, CNPJ/CPF or date.",fiscal_mes_titulo:"Follow the month's tax obligations",fiscal_mes_resumo:"What the tax authority asks for, each unit's monthly checklist and how long the tax incentives are valid.",fiscal_mes_busca:"tax obligation obligations deadline tax authority sefaz incentive tax benefit checklist dte fiscal obriga\xe7\xe3o prazo benef\xedcio",fiscal_mes_p1_titulo:"\"Tax authority requires action\"",fiscal_mes_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Tax, the red block at the top lists messages from the tax authority with a deadline. Tap \"I'm on it\" or \"Resolved\" (write what was done).",fiscal_mes_p2_titulo:"\"Month\" tab",fiscal_mes_p2_texto:"The checklist of obligations for each unit.",fiscal_mes_p3_titulo:"Choose the month and mark",fiscal_mes_p3_texto:"Use \u2039 and \u203a to change the period. On each obligation, tap \"OK\", \"Pending\", \"Discrepancy\" or \"Not applicable\".",fiscal_mes_p4_titulo:"\"Incentives\" tab",fiscal_mes_p4_texto:"Shows until when each tax incentive is valid. Red = expired or less than 30 days left.",fiscal_mes_cuidado:"A message from the tax authority with a deadline must not be missed: tell the accountant the same day.",cadastrar_cliente_titulo:"Add a customer or supplier",cadastrar_cliente_resumo:"Who buys from the factory (and receives the outgoing invoice) or who sells to it.",cadastrar_cliente_busca:"add customer client supplier cnpj cpf state registration new record cadastrar cliente fornecedor",cadastrar_cliente_p1_titulo:"Tap \uff0b",cadastrar_cliente_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Customers (or Suppliers), tap \uff0b.",cadastrar_cliente_p2_titulo:"Fill in and save",cadastrar_cliente_p2_texto:"Choose the type (Customer, Supplier or Both) and fill in \"Name / Legal name\", CNPJ/CPF, [[ie|state registration]], contact and city. Tap \"Save\".",cadastrar_cliente_dica:"To change a record, tap the name in the list. Search finds by name, CNPJ or city.",representantes_titulo:"Add a sales rep and their commission",representantes_resumo:"Who sells for the factory, their region and default commission.",representantes_busca:"sales rep representative salesperson commission region add rc representante vendedor comiss\xe3o",representantes_p1_titulo:"Tap \uff0b",representantes_p1_texto:"In Factory \u203a Sales reps, tap \uff0b.",representantes_p2_titulo:"Fill in and save",representantes_p2_texto:"\"Name\", \"Default commission (%)\", \"Region\", phone and e-mail. Tap \"Save\".",representantes_dica:"In the calculator, when you choose the sales rep for the quote, their commission fills in on its own.",painel_cliente_titulo:"See a customer's dashboard (My clients)",painel_cliente_resumo:"Stock, silo, expenses, rainfall and field work for each grower customer.",painel_cliente_busca:"my clients dashboard grower customer farm report pdf meus clientes painel produtor",painel_cliente_p1_titulo:"Open \"MY CLIENTS\"",painel_cliente_p1_texto:"On Home, tap \"MY CLIENTS\".",painel_cliente_p2_titulo:"Choose the customer",painel_cliente_p2_texto:"Tap the customer's name in the buttons at the top. Also choose the year and month.",painel_cliente_p3_titulo:"Create the PDF",painel_cliente_p3_texto:"Tap \"GENERATE PDF REPORT\" to send it to the customer.",lab_novo_pedido_titulo:"Open an analysis order at the laboratory",lab_novo_pedido_resumo:"Record the arrival of a customer's samples.",lab_novo_pedido_busca:"laboratory lab order analysis sample reception customer laborat\xf3rio pedido an\xe1lise amostra",lab_novo_pedido_p1_titulo:"Open the Laboratory",lab_novo_pedido_p1_texto:"In the bottom menu, tap Lab and then \"LABORATORY\".",lab_novo_pedido_p2_titulo:"Tap \"NEW ORDER\"",lab_novo_pedido_p2_texto:"On the orders screen.",lab_novo_pedido_p3_titulo:"Fill in the 5 blocks",lab_novo_pedido_p3_texto:"1 Customer \xb7 2 Who pays and who follows up \xb7 3 Material \xb7 4 Agreement \xb7 5 Deadline and notes. Tap \"CREATE ORDER\".",lab_novo_pedido_p4_titulo:"Find an order later",lab_novo_pedido_p4_texto:"In the search box, type the order, sample or report number, or the customer, and tap \"SEARCH\".",lab_novo_pedido_dica:"The laboratory uses the left column to move around: Orders, Samples, Results, Reports\u2026",lab_laudos_titulo:"Find and download a lab report",lab_laudos_resumo:"All reports issued: whose it is, when it came out, whether it was delivered.",lab_laudos_busca:"report reports lab report download pdf deliver issued laboratory laudo laudos",lab_laudos_p1_titulo:"Search",lab_laudos_p1_texto:"In Laboratory \u203a Reports, type the customer, the number or the date and tap \"SEARCH\". The filters show \"To deliver\" and \"Delivered\".",lab_laudos_p2_titulo:"Download",lab_laudos_p2_texto:"Tap the report to open it and tap \"PDF\" (or \"XLSX\").",nfse_lab_titulo:"Issue the laboratory's service invoice (NFS-e)",nfse_lab_resumo:"A Carpes's [[nfse|NFS-e]] for laboratory analysis or precision agriculture.",nfse_lab_busca:"nfse service invoice laboratory analysis a carpes city hall nota de servi\xe7o prefeitura",nfse_lab_p1_titulo:"Check the notice and the environment",nfse_lab_p1_texto:"On the Service invoices screen, the notice at the top lists what is waiting for the accountant's approval. While there are items, only \"Test environment\" works. Choose the type.",nfse_lab_p2_titulo:"Service recipient",nfse_lab_p2_texto:"Choose a laboratory order (it fills in everything) or \"Standalone (no order)\" and type the recipient's CNPJ/CPF and name.",nfse_lab_p3_titulo:"Description and amount",nfse_lab_p3_texto:"Check the service description and the amount.",nfse_lab_p4_titulo:"Review and issue",nfse_lab_p4_texto:"Tap \"Review and issue\", check the summary and tap \"YES, issue\". The invoice goes into the queue.",nfse_lab_cuidado:"This screen can't cancel an NFS-e yet. In production, the invoice only goes out after the accountant's approval.",liberar_cadastro_titulo:"Give access to someone who signed up in the app",liberar_cadastro_resumo:"Someone who created an account on their own stays \"Waiting for access\" and sees an empty screen until you give access.",liberar_cadastro_busca:"give access sign up access approve user new waiting link customer liberar cadastro acesso usu\xe1rio",liberar_cadastro_p1_titulo:"See the queue",liberar_cadastro_p1_texto:"In Access, the \"\u23f3 Waiting for access\" section lists who is waiting.",liberar_cadastro_p2_titulo:"Tap the person",liberar_cadastro_p2_texto:"Tap the person's row to open the options.",liberar_cadastro_p3_titulo:"Link to the customer",liberar_cadastro_p3_texto:"Tap \"Link to a client\", search for the customer (3 letters) and tap it. The person then sees that customer's maps.",liberar_cadastro_p4_titulo:"Or give a team mode",liberar_cadastro_p4_texto:"In \"App mode:\", choose Grower, Field, Laboratory or Agronomist.",liberar_cadastro_dica:"There is no \"Approve\" button: giving access means linking to a customer or giving a mode.",senha_bloquear_titulo:"Send a new password or block someone",senha_bloquear_resumo:"When the person forgot their password or should no longer get in.",senha_bloquear_busca:"password forgot new password block unblock access user senha bloquear desbloquear",senha_bloquear_p1_titulo:"Tap the person",senha_bloquear_p1_texto:"In Access, search for the person and tap their row.",senha_bloquear_p2_titulo:"New password",senha_bloquear_p2_texto:"Tap \"\ud83d\udd11 Send new password link\" and confirm. They receive the link by e-mail.",senha_bloquear_p3_titulo:"Block",senha_bloquear_p3_texto:"Tap \"\u26d4 Block access\" and confirm. To undo, \"\u2705 Unblock access\".",senha_bloquear_cuidado:"Laboratory and Agronomist see the maps of ALL customers. Give these modes only to the team.",custo_agente_titulo:"See how much the WhatsApp agent is costing",custo_agente_resumo:"The cost in dollars for each person who talked to the agent.",custo_agente_busca:"cost agent whatsapp dollar how much conversations custo agente quanto custa",custo_agente_p1_titulo:"Tap \"WhatsApp agent cost\"",custo_agente_p1_texto:"In Access, tap the \"\ud83e\udd16 WhatsApp agent cost\" card.",custo_agente_p2_titulo:"Choose the period",custo_agente_p2_texto:"Tap \"7 days\" or \"30 days\". See the total cost, per person and per day.",atribuir_talhao_titulo:"Assign a field to a customer",atribuir_talhao_resumo:"Send the outline of a field (KML or GeoJSON file) to a customer's account.",atribuir_talhao_busca:"field plot assign customer kml geojson map polygon talh\xe3o talhao atribuir",atribuir_talhao_p1_titulo:"Choose the customer and the name",atribuir_talhao_p1_texto:"In Access, in the \"\ud83c\udfaf Assign a field to a client\" block: search for the customer and type the field's name.",atribuir_talhao_p2_titulo:"Choose the file",atribuir_talhao_p2_texto:"Tap \"\ud83d\udce5 Select file and assign\" and choose the KML or GeoJSON.",atribuir_talhao_dica:"The file must have the field's polygon; the points are optional.",idioma_tema_titulo:"Change the language or the theme (light/dark)",idioma_tema_resumo:"The app in Portuguese, English or Spanish, and the light or dark theme.",idioma_tema_busca:"language english spanish portuguese idioma theme light dark color profile tema",idioma_tema_p1_titulo:"Language",idioma_tema_p1_texto:"In Profile, in the \"APP LANGUAGE\" block, tap the language.",idioma_tema_p2_titulo:"Theme",idioma_tema_p2_texto:"In the \"APP THEME\" block, tap \"Light\" or \"Dark\".",falar_por_voz_titulo:"Talk to the agent by voice",falar_por_voz_resumo:"Ask out loud, as on WhatsApp, and hear the answer.",falar_por_voz_busca:"voice speak talk jarvis oscarpes microphone assistant audio voz falar",falar_por_voz_p1_titulo:"Tap the round Oscarpes button",falar_por_voz_p1_texto:"It sits in the bottom right corner, on every screen.",falar_por_voz_p2_titulo:"Tap the microphone and speak",falar_por_voz_p2_texto:"Tap \"Tap to speak\", ask your question and tap again to stop. The answer comes back by voice.",falar_por_voz_p3_titulo:"Continuous conversation",falar_por_voz_p3_texto:"With \"Continuous conversation\" on, it starts listening again on its own after answering.",falar_por_voz_p4_titulo:"Or type",falar_por_voz_p4_texto:"Prefer typing? Use \"Or type here\u2026\" and \"Send\".",falar_por_voz_dica:"You can ask anything you would ask on WhatsApp: prices, bills, income statement\u2026",falar_por_voz_cuidado:"Voice works in the browser (Safari on iPhone, Chrome or Safari on the computer). In the installed app, only typing works.",trocar_voz_titulo:"Change the assistant's voice",trocar_voz_resumo:"Pick another voice, including the natural voices.",trocar_voz_busca:"change voice natural edresson faber jarvis assistant voice trocar voz",trocar_voz_p1_titulo:"Download the natural voice (once)",trocar_voz_p1_texto:"On the conversation screen, tap \"Download natural voice\" \u2014 Wi-Fi is better.",trocar_voz_p2_titulo:"Change the voice",trocar_voz_p2_texto:"Tap \"Voice: \u2026\". Each tap moves to the next voice and plays a sample.",trocar_voz_dica:"Your choice is saved on this device.",pedir_ao_agente_titulo:"What I can ask the agent on WhatsApp",pedir_ao_agente_resumo:"Ready-made messages for the most common questions \u2014 the agent answers with the same numbers as the app.",pedir_ao_agente_busca:"agent whatsapp ask question message what it does help agente perguntar",pedir_ao_agente_p1_titulo:"Ask your own way",pedir_ao_agente_p1_texto:"Examples: price of a blend with freight and commission; overdue bills; who owes us; the year's income statement; updating the price of a raw material (you can send a photo of the invoice).",pedir_ao_agente_p2_titulo:"Confirm before saving",pedir_ao_agente_p2_texto:"When the request saves something, the agent shows a summary and only saves after your YES.",pedir_ao_agente_dica:"Not sure what to ask? Send \"What can you do?\" and it lists what you can ask for.",pedir_ao_agente_zap:"What can you do?",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_titulo:"Record a fertilizer, lime or gypsum application",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_resumo:"Base, broadcast and side-dress fertilization, liming and gypsum in the field logbook, with nutrient per hectare.",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_busca:"fertilizer lime liming gypsum side-dress broadcast base planting furrow kcl urea npk guarantee logbook application adubo calcario gesso",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_p1_titulo:"Open the logbook and tap record",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_p1_texto:"With the farm chosen in the top bar, tap \"Record application\".",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_p2_titulo:"Choose the type of fertilization",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_p2_texto:"Under \"Soil fertilization\": base (in-furrow), broadcast (before planting), side-dress. Under \"Soil correction\": liming and gypsum.",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_p3_titulo:"Say how it was applied",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_p3_texto:"The screen only shows what fits the type: broadcast spreader, variable rate, planter, aerial (solid) or pivot.",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_p4_titulo:"Product, rate and guarantee",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_p4_texto:"Type the product and rate (lime and gypsum in t/ha). For the guarantee, copy it from the invoice: 04-14-08, KCl 60%, CaO 30% MgO 15%. Tap add.",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_p5_titulo:"Check the nutrient per hectare",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_p5_texto:"The app adds up N, P2O5, K2O, Ca, Mg and S per hectare. If the field has a saved recommendation, tap it to see if you were within, below or above.",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_p6_titulo:"Area and save",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_p6_texto:"Enter the applied area and save. If marked \"done\", the product leaves the warehouse.",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_dica:"Register the guarantee once in the warehouse (fertilizer or lime category): the logbook fills it in by itself next time.",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_cuidado:"Without the guarantee the app does NOT make up the nutrient: \"KCl\" without the number doesn't become 60%. Write P2O5 and K2O, not P and K.",registrar_aplicacao_adubo_zap:"I applied 2 t/ha of lime on field 5 of Farm X, broadcast, today"}},800,[]);
